Marks of the recipes
--------------------
The marks in src/noust/recipes/assets/_simple-icons/ are copied unchanged from the simple-icons
collection (https://github.com/simple-icons/simple-icons), published under CC0 1.0 Universal
(https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/) except where the collection records another licence
for a mark: that mark is in the list below, and _simple-icons/index.json says it mark by mark. The licence
covers the files and not the brands: each mark is the trademark of its owner, shown to say which project
a recipe installs and not to suggest that the project made, endorses or supports the recipe or Noust. The
folder's NOTICE says which release of the collection the files come from.

